WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for trailer.mp4, timed to the narration.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Quiet ambient music]

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.300
Your code lives on more than one forge.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.000
Pull requests here. Merge requests there.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
A failing pipeline, somewhere.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.800
What if you could hold it all in one place?

6
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.000
[Metal clang as the tongs close]

7
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.000
tongs finds your repositories
and gathers every review into one inbox.

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.800
Real diffs, highlighted word by word.

9
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.200
Comment inline. Suggest the fix.

10
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.800
Send it as one review.

11
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.500
Follow CI down to the failing line.

12
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.800
Retry. Approve. Merge.

13
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.900
Prefer a window? Same drafts, on the desktop.

14
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.000
Your agents see it too, over MCP.

15
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.000
Every forge. One grip.

16
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.500
tongs. Unified code review for the terminal.
